<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for this website.">
	<div class="article-content">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p>Effective Date: October 1, 2026</p>

		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			This website uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for privacy-friendly web analytics. 
			It does not use cookies, does not track users across different websites, and does not collect any personally identifiable information (PII).
		</p>

		<h2>Embedded Content</h2>
		<p>
			Some articles on this site may include embedded content, such as YouTube videos. Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if you have visited the other website directly. 
			These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content—including tracking your interaction if you have an account and are logged in to that website. 
			Please refer to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for more information regarding YouTube embeds.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			If you have any questions about this privacy policy, you can reach out via my <a href="https://x.com/hereticpleb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Twitter/X</a> or email me at <a href="mailto:hereticplebeian@gmail.com">hereticplebeian@gmail.com</a>.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
